  "_class_names": "Class names must not reuse Mermaid's own SVG classes (root, node, cluster, edge, label, nodes, edgePaths): classDef root also matches the top-level <g class=\"root\"> and fills every edge.",
  "_about": "The house diagram theme. 'light' is what goes inline on GitHub (GitHub does not adapt init colors to dark mode, so the 'frame' card keeps the diagram readable on a dark page); 'dark' only exists for the generated SVGs shown through <picture>.",
  "_font": "Mermaid silently drops a fontFamily that contains a hyphenated generic (sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system) and the SVG falls back to serif. Name concrete families only.",
  "_icons": "Icon packs (logos:, mdi:) only work in generated SVGs: GitHub's viewer registers none and draws them as '?'. Inline, architecture-beta uses its built-in icons: cloud, database, disk, internet, server.",
  "_text": "light.textColor is a mid tone (#5E7D75): architecture labels and loose text use it, and on GitHub dark mode they sit on the black page. Contrast 4.6:1 on white, about 4:1 on #0d1117.",
